-- ============================================================
-- Warrior (Protection): Incite, redesigned
-- ============================================================
-- TODO.md: "Incite (1, 1): Redesigned. Increases the damage of your Mocking
--           Blow by 33/66/100% and reduces its cooldown by 15/30/45 sec.
--           Mocked enemies reset the cooldown on Revenge when they attack you.
--           (3 ranks)"
--
-- Stock Incite is +5/10/15% critical strike chance on Heroic Strike, Thunder
-- Clap and Cleave.  It has to go regardless of taste: woa_2026_08_08_06.sql
-- rebuilt Heroic Strike and Cleave on the Cataclysm model (instant, 30 rage,
-- shared 3 second cooldown), which turned them into rage dumps fired off the
-- GCD rather than the abilities a Protection warrior's crit budget should be
-- pointed at.
--
-- The redesign makes Mocking Blow -- previously a taunt nobody pressed, and
-- until woa_2026_08_09_01.sql a taunt that dealt no damage at all against
-- anything taunt-immune -- into the button this talent is about.
--
-- Effect1 and Effect2 are pure DBC and need no explanation beyond the numbers:
--
--   Effect1  ADD_PCT_MODIFIER  / SPELLMOD_DAMAGE (0)    +33/66/100%
--   Effect2  ADD_FLAT_MODIFIER / SPELLMOD_COOLDOWN (11) -15/30/45 sec
--
-- Both are masked to SpellFamilyFlags 0x08000000, which is Mocking Blow and
-- only Mocking Blow across all seven ranks (verified with
-- `gen_sql.py classmask --family 4 --spells 694,7400,...,47504`).
--
-- The cooldown modifier works even though Mocking Blow's cooldown is a CATEGORY
-- cooldown (category 40, CategoryRecoveryTime 60000/120000 and RecoveryTime 0).
-- Player.cpp:10986-10989 applies SPELLMOD_COOLDOWN to catrec as well as rec,
-- provided the spell does not carry SPELL_ATTR6_NO_CATEGORY_COOLDOWN_MODS.
-- Mocking Blow's AttributesEx6 is 0, so it does not.
--
-- Effect3 is the one part that needs C++.  "Mocked enemies reset the cooldown
-- on Revenge when they attack you" has no DBC form: spell_proc can select the
-- event but cannot ask a question about the ATTACKER, and clearing a cooldown
-- is not a spell effect.  spell_warr_incite_revenge
-- (modules/world_of_alonecraft/src/WarriorIncite.cpp) hangs off this DUMMY.
--
-- KNOWN LIMITATION, stated here so it is not rediscovered as a bug: Mocking
-- Blow marks its victim with SPELL_AURA_MOD_TAUNT, and taunt does not land on
-- players (PlayerStorage.cpp:5686) or on boss-flagged creatures
-- (Creature.cpp:683).  Against those targets Mocking Blow still deals its
-- damage and still benefits from Effect1 and Effect2, but the Revenge reset
-- never fires because there is no aura to find.  Making it work everywhere
-- would mean giving Mocking Blow a second, non-taunt marker aura -- a larger
-- change than this talent justifies today.
--
-- spell_proc: ProcFlags 40 = 0x28 = PROC_FLAG_TAKEN_MELEE_AUTO_ATTACK (0x8)
-- | PROC_FLAG_TAKEN_SPELL_MELEE_DMG_CLASS (0x20), i.e. "when they attack you".
-- SpellPhaseMask 2 is mandatory -- a zero phase mask silently never fires.
-- Chance 0 = always; the script does the filtering.
--
-- Spells:
--   50685 / 50686 / 50687 = Incite ranks 1-3
-- ============================================================

